OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue dispersal order for
OL,4,Aparts of city
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a dispersal order in
OL,7,Fthree parts of Colchester over the
OL,8,FHalloween weekend to try to prevent
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FEssex Police said the order would be in
OL,12,Fplace between 16:00 GMT on Saturday and
OL,13,F16:00 on Sunday in the Shrub End,
OL,14,FGreenstead and Stanway areas of the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FOfficers can order people to leave a
OL,18,Fplace if they believe they are acting
OL,19,Fanti-socially, harassing or alarming
OL,20,Fmembers of the public.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
