OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue dispersal order for
OL,4,Aparts of city
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This order is to ensure everyone can
OL,7,Fenjoy their Halloween weekend without
OL,8,Fbeing affected by others acting
OL,9,Fanti-socially," said Insp Martin
OL,10,FWillsher, from the force.
